- **graceful** — Graceful-6x4 by Mikhael Goikhman, http://migo.n3.net/, 20/Jan/2002. Why did I make this font? Most of the figlet fonts are ugly for my taste. Chars ".", "'" or "|" are not as graceful as "(", ")", "/", "\" and "_". Also most of the fonts unlike this one are either small or good, not both. And finally, I wanted to have a strictly sized font, this one is 6x4. I intended to create this elegant figlet font in 1996, but only in January 2002 actually had the time to bring it to the working state. :) Cyrillic letters are supported, maybe somewhen I will add hebrew latters. To get a monospaced font 6x4, use "figlet -f graceful -m -1". Enjoy! Permission is hereby given to modify this font, as long as the modifier's name is added to this comment.
